  "ranulphsNotes": [
    [
      "<u>Ranulph's Notes</u>",
      "",
      "I would not have expected to",
      "find myself spending such",
      "time observing ents, yet they",
      "present a curious and",
      "repetitive ritual.",
      "",
      "From the moment I arrived",
      "in the Auburn Valley, it was",
      "clear the ents themselves held",
      "a high position in the valley",
      "hierarchy. There is little to",
      "no separation between the",
      "local population and the ents,"
    ],
    [
      "with many of the latter",
      "choosing to walk through the",
      "local town itself.",
      "",
      "My first objective was to",
      "investigate any potential",
      "interfacing between the ents",
      "and the locals. With this in",
      "mind, I began to observe the",
      "rituals being undertaken.",
      "",
      "One of the first and most",
      "noticeable elements of the",
      "ritual is the perpetual nature",
      "of it all. The ents do not"
    ],
    [
      "break from their paths, and",
      "there is no definition of a",
      "start or end. To become",
      "involved in the ritual, one",
      "must simply present",
      "themselves and begin to follow",
      "it.",
      "",
      "It appears the ritual itself",
      "revolves around a set of",
      "totems that represent the",
      "spirits of the forest. Initally, I",
      "assumed the totems to be a",
      "creation of the ents, but I",
      "have now learnt that it is in"
    ],
    [
      "fact the citizens of these",
      "lands that maintain them.",
      "The ents appear to appreciate",
      "these contributions, especially",
      "when the totems are accurate",
      "to the local spirits.",
      "",
      "This is not all, however. For",
      "a totem to be considered",
      "complete, it is apparently",
      "important for them to be",
      "decorated with cut and",
      "carved wooden objects.",
      "Apparently this is some form",
      "of returning material to the"
    ],
    [
      "forest in a manner the ents",
      "respect.",
      "",
      "For those interested in a",
      "consistent involvement in the",
      "ritual, I've noted that many",
      "follow the ents around to join",
      "them in appreciating the",
      "natural world. I believe they",
      "find it refreshing to pause",
      "and take in the sights of the",
      "forest.",
      "",
      "On moving through the",
      "forest, it is impossible to miss"
    ],
    [
      "that the footsteps of the ents",
      "occasionally causes",
      "spectacular growths to",
      "emerge. My understanding",
      "is that by walking through",
      "these growths, one can feel",
      "more connected to the ent",
      "that left it behind.",
      "",
      "I've not collected enough",
      "information to confirm, but I",
      "believe the ents offer more",
      "reward to those connected to",
      "them.",
      ""
    ],
    [
      "I'm sure there is more that I",
      "have not yet discovered so I",
      "will keep working to build a",
      "stronger picture of how this",
      "ritual process works.",
      "",
      "",
      "",
      "",
      "",
